Asset Identifiers
•	SRAN
o	Long Form: Stock Record Account Number
o	Meaning: A unique code assigned to a specific location (an Air Force Base, a depot) that holds and manages spare parts and equipment. It identifies where an asset is.
•	ASN
o	Long Form: Aircraft Serial Number
o	Meaning: The unique serial number assigned to an aircraft airframe, often referred to as the "tail number."
•	ESN
o	Long Form: Engine Serial Number
o	Meaning: The unique serial number assigned to a specific engine.


System & Data Sources:
•	IMIS - Integrated Maintenance Information System (Lockheed maintenance database)
•	AEFR - Automated Engine Fault Reporting (engine troubleshooting program within IMIS)
•	CeduLoad - CEDU Load (program that decodes engine binary files; CEDU likely = Control Electronic Display Unit)
•	CEMS - Comprehensive Engine Management System (maintains engine records)
•	ADEM - Advanced Diagnostics and Engine Management (Pratt & Whitney system)
Engine & Aircraft Identifiers:
•	EHM – Engine Health Management
•	OFP - Operational Flight Program (software version)
•	AC_OFP - Aircraft Operational Flight Program
•	ENG_OFP - Engine Operational Flight Program (engine logic version)
•	ESN – Engine Serial Number
•	ASN – Aircraft Serial Number
Fault & Maintenance Codes:
•	PRC - Problem Report Code (parent record for faults)
•	FRC - Fault Report Code (specific fault events)
•	FRAC - Likely typo of FRC, or Failure Report Analysis Code
•	FMECA - Failure Mode, Effects, and Criticality Analysis
•	JCN – Job Control Number (maintenance work order identifier)
Technical Analysis:
•	CGR - Crack Growth Rate (for fatigue analysis)
•	UBL - Usage-Based Lifing (predictive maintenance system)
Logistics & Inventory:
•	SRAN – Stock Record Account Number (base/location identifier)
•	LCN - Logistics Control Number (part position/location code)
These acronyms represent a comprehensive ecosystem of:
•	Maintenance tracking systems (IMIS, CEMS)
•	Health monitoring and diagnostics (EHM, AEFR, ADEM)
•	Data processing tools (CeduLoad)
•	Identification systems (serial numbers, control numbers)
•	Predictive analytics (UBL, CGR)
•	Logistics management (SRAN, LCN)
